      "body": "Automobile Corporation of Goa Limited announced that the term of appointment of Mr. Nagesh Pinge (DIN: 00062900) as an Independent Director of the Company ended on January 21, 2026. Consequently, Mr. Pinge ceased to be an Independent Director of Automobile Corporation of Goa Limited with effect from January 21, 2026. Consequent to his completion of term as an Independent Director, Mr. Pinge also ceased to be the Chairperson of the Audit Committee and the Corporate Investment Committee and a Member of the Risk Management Committee and the Capital Investment Committee of the Company. Date of Cessation Effective from the close of business hours of January 21, 2026.",
